OL,3,GNEWSAThe man who vowed to stop
OL,4,A'inhumane treatment of climbing boys'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the plaque unveiling at his former
OL,7,Fhome in Bowdon, councillor Eve Parker,
OL,8,Ffrom Trafford Council, said Wood's
OL,9,F"compassion, courage and lasting impact
OL,10,Fon British history will be remembered
OL,11,Ffor generations to come".
